Package: tangerine-linux
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-venv, libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Ricco Herdiyan Saputra
Description: Tangerine Linux v1 - drop-zone + radial wheel file converter
 Konversi file lokal ala Tangerine for Mac: seret file ke drop-zone,
 pilih format di radial wheel, hasil disimpan di sebelah file asli.
 Mendukung PDF, gambar, video, audio, dan teks. Semua proses lokal.
